KOPIMI (www.kopimi.com)

    Copying is an act of love. Please copy and share.

FTW ("Fuck Teh World") is Kopimi. You are encouraged — blessed, even — to
copy this software, share it with your friends, remix it, print it on a
t-shirt, read it aloud on pirate radio, or tattoo the source on anything
that will hold still.

In plain terms, as close as prose gets to a license:

1. You may copy, redistribute, modify, and use this software for any
   purpose, commercial or otherwise, without asking permission and without
   paying anyone anything.
2. No warranty of any kind is provided. If it breaks, you get to keep
   both pieces.
3. Attribution is appreciated but not required. If you fork it, a nod is
   nice; if you don't, the copies will survive anyway.
4. The one rule that matters is not in this file: only point this tool at
   systems you own or have written permission to test. Kopimi covers the
   code, not your conduct. Unauthorized scanning is on you.

